inurl:dnn.js Reveals Raw Javascript of the Dot Net Nuke CMS of websites that may be vulnerable to XSS ( CVE-2013-4649 ) via searching the page text for the string ' Type.registerNamespace("dnn") ' .
Vulnerable versions: - DNN 7.1.0 and earlier - DNN 6.2.8 and earlier
POC: http://www.vulnerable.com/?__dnnVariable={'__dnn_pageload':'alert(/XSS/)'}

Exposes gravity forms WordPress plugin and add-on debugging logs. This can lead to exposure of form submission information including transaction data, PII and disclosure of plugin versions and directory structures.
Happy Hunting
